<title>JAPAN: Kobe rubber market is closed for national holiday.</title>
<headline>Kobe rubber market is closed for national holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kobe rubber futures market is closed on Monday for a national holiday. It will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, prices ranged from unchanged to 0.3 yen per kg lower than the day's close. Benchmark February was down 0.1 yen at 139.4 yen.</p>
</text>
